  "content": "\n\n![](https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/CUSTOM_NETHER_PORTALS/MP_CUSTOM_NETHER_PORTALS_Header.webp)\n\n<div><div><div><div><div><div><div><div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: book antiqua, palatino, serif; font-size: 18px;\">受夠了千篇一律的下界傳送門了嗎？</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: book antiqua, palatino, serif; font-size: 18px;\">這個模組讓你能夠以任何形狀、大小和方向建造通往下界的傳送門：無論是在地板、牆壁、天花板或是懸浮在空中皆可。這個模組讓你能夠以任何形狀、大小和方向建造通往下界的傳送門：無論是在地板、牆壁、天花板或是懸浮在空中皆可。</span></p></div></div></div></div><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/CUSTOM_NETHER_PORTALS/MP_CUSTOM_NETHER_PORTALS_Description.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"2382\" height=\"236\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: book antiqua, palatino, serif;\">透過「自訂下界傳送門」打破常規限制：打造任何尺寸與形狀的下界傳送門。擁有完全自由，建造通往下界的史詩級入口。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: book antiqua, palatino, serif;\">本模組完全支援 Fabric、Forge 與 Neoforge，適用於 Minecraft 1.20.1 與 1.21.1。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: book antiqua, palatino, serif;\">此外，它與其他維度模組完美兼容。不會引發錯誤、衝突或干擾，確保你在自訂世界或模組整合包中獲得流暢且無縫的遊玩體驗。</span></p></div><div><p><span style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: book antiqua, palatino, serif;\"><strong>想和朋友一起玩嗎？</strong></span></p><p><a href=\"https://bisecthosting.com/thewizard\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1302224/description_7cd58fdf-ef60-4e09-97cd-40a197e13ed1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"126\"></strong></a></p><div><div><p><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-family: book antiqua, palatino, serif;\"><a href=\"https://bisecthosting.com/thewizard\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><strong>今天建立你的專屬 Minecraft 伺服器</strong></a></span><span style=\"font-family: book antiqua, palatino, serif;\">，並與好友一起享受無限冒險！我們的伺服器提供頂級效能與穩定的運作時間，保證為所有人帶來流暢愉快的遊戲體驗。輸入優惠碼 <a href=\"https://bisect